{"about_the_game":"<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.poster.avif?t=1756664173\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.webm?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.mp4?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore this fun but tricky world, where each card you flip can bring good or bad luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/aade73a7c33602e7d7a87b37d6a0ccaf.poster.avif?t=1756664173\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/aade73a7c33602e7d7a87b37d6a0ccaf.webm?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/aade73a7c33602e7d7a87b37d6a0ccaf.mp4?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The dirty forest changes each time, so every game is a new adventure full of surprises. Can you get good at flipping cards smartly and figure out why there's trash everywhere? A game that mixes thinking ahead, luck, and exploring into an exciting roguelike adventure you won't forget.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/3a7d0e196edc0acf2a5cb8a8e61dcaac.poster.avif?t=1756664173\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/3a7d0e196edc0acf2a5cb8a8e61dcaac.webm?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/3a7d0e196edc0acf2a5cb8a8e61dcaac.mp4?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic combat where every move matters. Carefully choose which cards to flip, and wisely decide which enemy to attack first and with what weapon!<br></li><li>Roguelike: Each defeat is a step forward. Collect scrolls as you play, then use them to expand your card pool, enhancing your chances in future runs through the corrupted forest!<br></li><li>Enjoy the atmospheric world of a polluted forest with vibrant, hand-painted graphics.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/c57a1e2a59593a2a5f14cb3a9243677b.poster.avif?t=1756664173\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/c57a1e2a59593a2a5f14cb3a9243677b.webm?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by amazing games like <i>Slay the Spire, Inscryption, Peglin, Shogun Showdown, Dice &amp; Fold</i> and many others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/7202104b9e1ca205f1b748c6f15d77eb.poster.avif?t=1756664173\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/7202104b9e1ca205f1b748c6f15d77eb.webm?t=1756664173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069800/extras/7202104b9e1ca205f1b748c6f15d77eb.mp4?t=1756664173\" t